00:34:11.685 --> 00:34:13.199
L4, Mule accounts.

400
00:34:13.479 --> 00:34:20.690
Fraud proceeds are sent by many victims to mule accounts, which forward them within minutes. to a few collector accounts.

401
00:34:20.970 --> 00:34:31.167
Legitimate look-alikes exist: small shops (many payers), people who pay rent right after. salary (pass-through), friends collecting group money and paying a vendor.

402
00:34:31.447 --> 00:34:34.114
