00:37:53.487 --> 00:37:54.831
Hot merchant account.

441
00:37:55.111 --> 00:37:55.901
Effect:

442
00:37:56.181 --> 00:37:57.802
Latency, lock waits.

443
00:37:58.082 --> 00:37:59.085
Mitigation:

444
00:37:59.365 --> 00:38:01.242
Journal + roll-up (L1).

445
00:38:01.522 --> 00:38:03.399
Roll-up past an uncommitted row.

446
00:38:03.679 --> 00:38:04.469
Effect:

447
00:38:04.749 --> 00:38:05.815
Lost credit.

448
00:38:06.095 --> 00:38:07.098
Mitigation:

449
00:38:07.378 --> 00:38:09.959
Mark rows, not high-water marks (L1).

450
00:38:10.239 --> 00:38:12.010
Rounding and day-count bugs.

451
00:38:12.290 --> 00:38:13.079
Effect:

452
00:38:13.359 --> 00:38:14.874
Mis-paid interest at scale.

453
00:38:15.154 --> 00:38:16.157
Mitigation:

454
00:38:16.437 --> 00:38:20.341
Decimal types, single rounding, tests against the terms (L3).

455
00:38:20.621 --> 00:38:21.602
Mule rings.

456
